# Build context for examples/Dockerfile is the repository root.
# Send only what that Dockerfile copies (sdk/, examples/, README.md) ...
*
!sdk/
!examples/
!README.md

# ... and never secrets or local build/editor junk from inside those.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv
**/venv
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
sdk/taco/_version.py
sdk/dist
sdk/build
